; BlitzLLVM side of the loading benchmarks (loading.bb, loading_meshes.bb): AsyncLoading, TextureReady and EntityReady. The timer
; and the flip every benchmark has are in bench_llvm.bi.

Function BenchAsync(on)
	AsyncLoading on
End Function

Function BenchReady(texture)
	Return TextureReady(texture)
End Function

Function BenchEntityReady(entity)
	Return EntityReady(entity)
End Function
